; Drop one of these over a building and drag the box (the CollisionShape3D gizmo)
; to cover its interior volume. Any tile whose cell center falls inside — and
; that sits above the player's head — is cut away completely so you can see in.
; It is a plain marker: no physics, detected by iso_grid via the "interior" group.

